summary:
Iteration 14 verification. Backend: new /app/backend/tests/test_iter14.py (9 cases: legacy template create with content_html + empty content_text, PUT with migrated plain text -> GET confirms content_text persisted and content_html=='', seed legacy templates intact, preview email_html=='' with {var} and {{var}} substitution, GET /api/settings + /api/public/branding company_name=='Smartize', /auth/me, bad-password login). All 9 pass. Full regression with '-n 0': 195 passed / 1 skipped (0 failures). Frontend (Playwright, carlos.miguel@smartize.pt): (1) HIGH bug FIXED for the empty-content_text case — a legacy template (content_html '<p>Ola {first_name}</p><p>Linha dois</p>', content_text '') opens in template-text-input already migrated as 'Ola {first_name}

Linha dois'; Guardar + reopen keeps the body; GET shows content_text migrated and content_html ''. Preview renders 'Ola João

Linha dois'. (2) a11y: ZERO 'Missing Description or aria-describedby for DialogContent' warnings for template-dialog and preview-dialog. (3) New plain-text template: subject/body variable insertion at cursor works ({{first_name}}, {{saudacao}}), preview substitutes sample data, save + delete work. (4) Configuracoes -> Geral shows 'Smartize' (no TEST_Smartize*); sidebar/header branding correct. (5) Modal footer buttons (Preview/Guardar) reachable at 768x620. (6) /contactos /grupos /campanhas /negocios /estatisticas: zero console errors. Test data created via UI/API was deleted; seeds 'QA Template 1/2' left untouched.
